; Pitch (issue #402, a Soccer stage): a flat, closed pitch 2016 wide with a goal at each end and a ledge
; either side of the centre spot. Symmetric left to right. Two teams of up to four start on their own halves.
; Rotation (Stage.mode_weights): weighted 4x for Soccer, and in any other mode dealt into a bag only 30% of the time.
